  <dashboards>
  <dashboard name='monitr-ai Product Analytics'>
    <style/>
    <size maxheight='2400' maxwidth='1600' minheight='2400' minwidth='1600'/>
    <zones>
      <zone h='100000' id='2' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
      <zone h='2800' id='11' type-v2='text' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
      <formatted-text>
        <run bold='true' fontsize='16' fontcolor='#0B5C46'>monitr-ai  |  PRODUCT ANALYTICS DASHBOARD  (PRE-LAUNCH / FREE BETA - usage data only, no payments)  |  Mar-Sep 2026  |  20,731 visitors -&gt; 1,440 signups -&gt; 964 key connections -&gt; 813 activated  |  recorded at DSU Campus (452) &amp; Outside Campus (988)</run>
      </formatted-text>
      </zone>
      <zone h='6000' id='12' type-v2='text' w='100000' x='0' y='2800'>
      <formatted-text>
        <run bold='true' fontsize='13' fontcolor='#173A5E'>KPI SCORECARD (latest complete month: Aug 2026)</run>
        <run fontsize='11' fontcolor='#173A5E'>  North Star - Weekly Observing Users: 231.7   |   MAU: 429   |   Stickiness DAU/MAU: 20.1%   |   Activation rate: 56.4%   |   NPS: 28.4</run>
        <run fontsize='11' fontcolor='#173A5E'>  Power users (&gt;=8 sessions/mo): 202   |   Next-month return: 77.4%   |   W4 retention: 48.4%   |   Invite/referral share: 33.0%</run>
        <run fontsize='11' fontcolor='#173A5E'>  Sessions: 3,195   |   Tokens monitored: 278.47M   |   Avg Cognitive Waste Index: 0.429 (lower=better)   |   Avg CRI: 0.205</run>
      </formatted-text>
      </zone>
      <zone h='1100' id='13' type-v2='text' w='100000' x='0' y='8800'>
      <formatted-text>
        <run bold='true' fontsize='12' fontcolor='#8A3B12'>KPI IDENTIFICATION &amp; ANALYSIS - monthly trends</run>
      </formatted-text>
      </zone>
      <zone h='9200' id='14' param='KPI North Star WOU Trend' type-v2='worksheet' w='25000' x='0' y='9900'/>
      <zone h='9200' id='15' param='KPI MAU Trend' type-v2='worksheet' w='25000' x='25000' y='9900'/>
      <zone h='9200' id='16' param='KPI Power Users Trend' type-v2='worksheet' w='25000' x='50000' y='9900'/>
      <zone h='9200' id='17' param='KPI Next Month Return Rate Trend' type-v2='worksheet' w='25000' x='75000' y='9900'/>
      <zone h='9200' id='18' param='KPI Activation Rate Trend' type-v2='worksheet' w='25000' x='0' y='19100'/>
      <zone h='9200' id='19' param='KPI Invite Referral Share Trend' type-v2='worksheet' w='25000' x='25000' y='19100'/>
      <zone h='9200' id='20' param='KPI W4 Retention Trend' type-v2='worksheet' w='25000' x='50000' y='19100'/>
      <zone h='9200' id='21' param='KPI Sessions Trend' type-v2='worksheet' w='25000' x='75000' y='19100'/>
      <zone h='9200' id='22' param='Quality Waste Index Trend' type-v2='worksheet' w='25000' x='0' y='28300'/>
      <zone h='9200' id='23' param='Quality CRI Trend' type-v2='worksheet' w='25000' x='25000' y='28300'/>
      <zone h='9200' id='24' param='KPI Tokens Monitored Trend' type-v2='worksheet' w='25000' x='50000' y='28300'/>
      <zone h='9200' id='25' param='KPI Visitor to Signup CVR Trend' type-v2='worksheet' w='25000' x='75000' y='28300'/>
      <zone h='5800' id='26' type-v2='text' w='100000' x='0' y='37500'>
      <formatted-text>
        <run bold='true' fontsize='12' fontcolor='#173A5E'>KPI FRAMEWORK (formulas - full catalogue in kpi_definitions.csv):  North Star WOU = COUNTD(user_id) with &gt;=1 monitored session per ISO week  |  Signup-&gt;Key = users with apiConfigs row / signups  |  Activation = first session &lt;=7d after key / signups  |  Stickiness = avg(DAU)/MAU  |  Pre-launch churn = inactivity: next-month return = active(m) INTERSECT active(m+1) / active(m); 30d-inactive overall = 36.3%  |  Growth (pre-launch) = invite+referral share = 35.4%  |  Product value = avg Cognitive Waste Index &amp; Efficiency Ratio; Product safety = avg CRI &amp; security events/100 sessions.</run>
      </formatted-text>
      </zone>
      <zone h='1100' id='27' type-v2='text' w='100000' x='0' y='43300'>
      <formatted-text>
        <run bold='true' fontsize='12' fontcolor='#8A3B12'>FUNNEL ANALYSIS - visit -&gt; signup -&gt; API key -&gt; activation</run>
      </formatted-text>
      </zone>
      <zone h='9500' id='28' param='Funnel Stage Volumes' type-v2='worksheet' w='44000' x='0' y='44400'/>
      <zone h='9500' id='29' param='Funnel Conversion From Previous' type-v2='worksheet' w='30000' x='44000' y='44400'/>
      <zone h='9500' id='30' param='Funnel Median Days Between Stages' type-v2='worksheet' w='26000' x='74000' y='44400'/>
      <zone h='9000' id='31' param='Funnel By Channel' type-v2='worksheet' w='52000' x='0' y='53900'/>
      <zone h='9000' id='32' param='Funnel By Location' type-v2='worksheet' w='48000' x='52000' y='53900'/>
      <zone h='5500' id='33' type-v2='text' w='100000' x='0' y='62900'>
      <formatted-text>
        <run bold='true' fontsize='12' fontcolor='#8A3B12'>FUNNEL INSIGHTS:  * Visit-&gt;Signup (6.95%) is the biggest leak: newsletter (63.3% activation), referral &amp; HN are best-fit channels; organic/paid traffic needs an interactive demo + docs deep-links.  * Signup-&gt;Key (66.9%) is the biggest intentional friction (API-key anxiety): auto-detect UX, read-only-scope guidance, OAuth.  * Key-&gt;Activation (84.3% &lt;=7d, median TTA 1d): activated users return next month at 77.4% - activation is the retention gateway.  * DSU Campus: workshop floods (51.1%) convert to keys but stall before activation (50.0% vs 59.4%) - add day-2 nudges &amp; lab follow-ups.</run>
      </formatted-text>
      </zone>
      <zone h='1100' id='34' type-v2='text' w='100000' x='0' y='68400'>
      <formatted-text>
        <run bold='true' fontsize='12' fontcolor='#8A3B12'>USER BEHAVIOUR ANALYSIS - segments, programs, features, cohorts</run>
      </formatted-text>
      </zone>
      <zone h='9000' id='35' param='Behaviour Signups By Channel' type-v2='worksheet' w='25000' x='0' y='69500'/>
      <zone h='9000' id='36' param='Behaviour Users By Location' type-v2='worksheet' w='25000' x='25000' y='69500'/>
      <zone h='9000' id='37' param='Behaviour Users By Persona' type-v2='worksheet' w='25000' x='50000' y='69500'/>
      <zone h='9000' id='38' param='Behaviour Activation Rate By Persona' type-v2='worksheet' w='25000' x='75000' y='69500'/>
      <zone h='9000' id='39' param='Behaviour Signups By Program' type-v2='worksheet' w='25000' x='0' y='78500'/>
      <zone h='9000' id='40' param='Behaviour Activation Rate By Location' type-v2='worksheet' w='25000' x='25000' y='78500'/>
      <zone h='9000' id='41' param='Behaviour Onboarding Rate By Location' type-v2='worksheet' w='25000' x='50000' y='78500'/>
      <zone h='9000' id='42' param='Behaviour Sessions By Hour' type-v2='worksheet' w='25000' x='75000' y='78500'/>
      <zone h='9000' id='43' param='Behaviour Feature Adoption All' type-v2='worksheet' w='50000' x='0' y='87500'/>
      <zone h='9000' id='44' param='Behaviour Retention Cohort Heatmap' type-v2='worksheet' w='50000' x='50000' y='87500'/>
      <zone h='3500' id='45' type-v2='text' w='100000' x='0' y='96500'>
      <formatted-text>
        <run bold='true' fontsize='12' fontcolor='#173A5E'>BEHAVIOUR INSIGHTS: * Power engineers (Security 67.3%, ML 64.1% activation) drive 1.3-2x sessions - build beta community around them; PMs/Founders (36.2/34.8%) need guided first sessions.  * DSU Campus: 15.7 sessions/user, 35.8% 30d-inactive (post-workshop drift) vs Outside 36.5% - semester-start re-engagement pushes.  * Weekday-heavy usage, peak 11:00 UTC - digests at 08-10 UTC.  * Alerts lag in adoption but alert users retain ~2x better - prompt alert setup in the first session.  * Cohorts flatten after wk3 at ~40-50% of activated - durable habit pocket in Security &amp; Compliance use-cases.</run>
      </formatted-text>
      </zone>
      </zone>
    </zones>
  </dashboard>
  <dashboard name='Data Collection and Methodology'>
    <style/>
    <size maxheight='1400' maxwidth='1600' minheight='1400' minwidth='1600'/>
    <zones>
      <zone h='100000' id='2' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
      <zone h='5000' id='46' type-v2='text' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
      <formatted-text>
        <run bold='true' fontsize='16' fontcolor='#0B5C46'>DATA COLLECTION - SOURCES, METHODS &amp; RELEVANCE (one CSV per product recording place + one per collection location)</run>
        <run fontsize='14' fontcolor='#0B5C46'>PRE-LAUNCH NOTE: product is in free beta. Datasets carry ZERO billing/payment fields - pure usage, funnel, engagement &amp; product-quality analytics.</run>
      </formatted-text>
      </zone>
      <zone h='45000' id='47' type-v2='text' w='50000' x='0' y='5000'>
      <formatted-text>
        <run bold='true' fontsize='13' fontcolor='#173A5E'>P1  WEB_VISITORS.CSV  - 20,731 rows, one per unique visitor</run>
        <run fontsize='11' fontcolor='#173A5E'>Source: Google Analytics 4 (gtag.js G-FK3PF0KZ2R) embedded in frontend/index.html with user-id stitching via localStorage firebase_uid.</run>
        <run fontsize='11' fontcolor='#173A5E'>Method: passive event collection (page_view, cta_click) + UTM attribution + device/geo from request headers.</run>
        <run fontsize='11' fontcolor='#173A5E'>Relevance: top of funnel. visit-&gt;signup CVR, channel/campaign effectiveness, content views (pricing/docs/demo) that predict conversion.</run>
        <run fontsize='11' fontcolor='#173A5E'></run>
        <run fontsize='11' fontcolor='#173A5E'>P2  USER_SIGNUPS.CSV  - 1,440 rows, one per account</run>
        <run fontsize='11' fontcolor='#173A5E'>Source: Firebase Authentication records created by frontend/auth.html; enriched with signup_program (open_beta / waitlist / invite_code / campus_workshop) and onboarding state. NO billing data exists.</run>
        <run fontsize='11' fontcolor='#173A5E'>Method: authoritative transactional store (account_created event); joined back to P1 via anonymous_visitor_id (identity resolution).</run>
        <run fontsize='11' fontcolor='#173A5E'>Relevance: the 'who'. Segments (persona, industry, company size, use case, collection_location, program), cohort_month for retention, activation &amp; engagement flags defining funnel stages 2-4.</run>
      </formatted-text>
      </zone>
      <zone h='45000' id='48' type-v2='text' w='50000' x='50000' y='5000'>
      <formatted-text>
        <run bold='true' fontsize='13' fontcolor='#173A5E'>P3  API_KEY_CONFIGS.CSV  - 1,194 rows, one per provider key connection</run>
        <run fontsize='11' fontcolor='#173A5E'>Source: Convex apiConfigs table, populated by frontend/key.html (provider auto-detect, key validation ping, model select, provider token prices for the USER'S OWN LLM spend estimate).</run>
        <run fontsize='11' fontcolor='#173A5E'>Method: direct database export of the connection entity; validation attempts/latency captured during the connect UX.</run>
        <run fontsize='11' fontcolor='#173A5E'>Relevance: the critical middle funnel stage (signup -&gt; key -&gt; value). Provider/model mix, days-to-connect, validation friction locate onboarding drop-off causes.</run>
        <run fontsize='11' fontcolor='#173A5E'></run>
        <run fontsize='11' fontcolor='#173A5E'>P4  MONITORING_SESSIONS.CSV  - 13,385 rows, one per monitoring session</run>
        <run fontsize='11' fontcolor='#173A5E'>Source: Convex real-time telemetry schema (sessions, metrics, cognitiveRiskIndex, securityEvents, auditLog) powering frontend/dashboard.html &amp; telemetry.html; mirrored to Postgres via etl/webhook.ts + dbt models.</run>
        <run fontsize='11' fontcolor='#173A5E'>Method: server-side event logging on every observed LLM interaction: tokens, latency, monitored LLM cost, efficiency, waste index, CRI components, security events, feature flags.</run>
        <run fontsize='11' fontcolor='#173A5E'>Relevance: the behavioral truth set. Powers engagement (MAU/WAU/stickiness/power users), cohort retention, product-value (waste, efficiency) and safety (CRI, security events) KPIs.</run>
      </formatted-text>
      </zone>
      <zone h='50000' id='49' type-v2='text' w='55000' x='0' y='50000'>
      <formatted-text>
        <run bold='true' fontsize='13' fontcolor='#173A5E'>COLLECTION LOCATIONS (one user file each)</run>
        <run fontsize='11' fontcolor='#173A5E'>* USERS_DSU_CAMPUS.CSV  - 452 rows, one per user recorded at DSU Campus (Bengaluru).</run>
        <run fontsize='11' fontcolor='#173A5E'>    Collection method: on-campus collection - users recorded on the campus network &amp; devices (labs, class demos, workshops). Profile: students &amp; researchers; 44.0% .edu emails, mobile-heavy, 51.1% via campus_workshop program.</run>
        <run fontsize='11' fontcolor='#173A5E'>    Relevance: education/adoption channel. Explains signup volume, exploratory behaviour (red-team &amp; stress tests) and post-workshop engagement decay; measures the student pipeline.</run>
        <run fontsize='11' fontcolor='#173A5E'>* USERS_OUTSIDE_CAMPUS.CSV  - 988 rows, one per user recorded outside campus.</run>
        <run fontsize='11' fontcolor='#173A5E'>    Collection method: organic global traffic - GA4 geo/device signals + professional personas, company emails; 31.6% arrive via invites/referrals.</run>
        <run fontsize='11' fontcolor='#173A5E'>    Relevance: the professional beta base. Higher activation (59.4%), deeper sustained engagement (16.8 sessions/user); the segment PMF decisions should be tuned on.</run>
        <run fontsize='11' fontcolor='#173A5E'>* Field schema is IDENTICAL in both location files (and matches user_signups.csv) so they stack/union 1:1 and join onward to P3/P4 via user_id.</run>
      </formatted-text>
      </zone>
      <zone h='50000' id='50' type-v2='text' w='45000' x='55000' y='50000'>
      <formatted-text>
        <run bold='true' fontsize='13' fontcolor='#173A5E'>COLLECTION &amp; GOVERNANCE NOTES</run>
        <run fontsize='11' fontcolor='#173A5E'>* Identity chain: anonymous_visitor_id (GA) == anonymous_visitor_id (signup) -&gt; user_id -&gt; config_id -&gt; session_id; collection_location stamped at first recording, denormalized downstream.</run>
        <run fontsize='11' fontcolor='#173A5E'>* Period: 2026-03-01 .. 2026-09-20 (synthetic, seeded generator - fully reproducible).</run>
        <run fontsize='11' fontcolor='#173A5E'>* Flags stored as 0/1 integers so AVG(field) in Tableau = rate (e.g. AVG(activated_within_7d_flag) = activation rate).</run>
        <run fontsize='11' fontcolor='#173A5E'>* No raw prompts/responses/PII exported - only structured risk scores &amp; counts (mirrors the product's zero-trust stance).</run>
        <run fontsize='11' fontcolor='#173A5E'>* Derived sets (funnel_*, kpi_monthly*, retention_cohorts, feature_adoption_*) computed from P1-P4 - the same SQL you'd write in the dbt layer.</run>
      </formatted-text>
      </zone>
      </zone>
    </zones>
  </dashboard>
  </dashboards>
</workbook>